  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia Online Studies Scholarship 2019 Intake (Samoa)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Australia Online Studies Scholarship (AOSS) investment supports the delivery of distance (online) education within Samoa, facilitating skills development while retaining the student in country. This supports candidates with family and work responsibilities, including women, who wish to continue current employment. Consistent with the goals and objectives of the broader Australia Awards scholarships program, the goal of the AOSS is to develop capacity and leadership skills so that individuals can contribute to Samoa&apos;s development. The program also builds people-to-people linkages at individual, institutional and country levels. This investment supported the 2019 intake.</narrative>
  </description>
